WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.400
Before you trust an app with years of your life, you should know you can take it all with you.

2
00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:10.713
In Settings, tap Export my journal. You get one zip.

3
00:00:11.763 --> 00:00:15.588
Every entry has its own folder, named by the day it's about.

4
00:00:16.638 --> 00:00:23.399
Inside: the original video, the subtitles, and every word you said, with the date and title.

5
00:00:24.449 --> 00:00:29.556
Your thoughts come too. Sealed capsules join once they open.

6
00:00:30.606 --> 00:00:35.181
It's free, any time. Export my journal is in Settings.
